'''''Pistacia saportae''''' is a species of tree in the family [[Anacardiaceae]]<ref>{{Cite web|title=Pistacia saportae Burnat - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/52204690|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Pistacia × saportae (Hybrid Mastic Tree) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/ANCR/Pistacia_saportae.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref> growing in the Mediterranean zone.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Pistacia × saportae Burnat {{!}} Plants of the World Online {{!}} Kew Science |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:70269-1 |access-date=2025-05-20 |website=Plants of the World Online |language=en}}</ref> It has been named in honour of [[Gaston de Saporta]].<ref>{{Cite book |last=Burnat |first=Émile |url=https://www.biodiversitylibrary.org/bibliography/11537 |title=Flore des Alpes maritimes; ou, Catalogue raisonné des plantes qui croissent spontanément dans la chaine des Alpes maritimes |last2=Burnat |first2=Émile |last3=Briquet |first3=John |last4=Cavillier |first4=François Georges |date=1892 |publisher=H. Georg |location=Genève}}</ref>

